# Push verification (before `git push`)

**Canonical (Claude · Codex · Cursor):** [`scripts/agent-gates/README.md`](../../scripts/agent-gates/README.md) + root [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) Checks.  
This file is a Cursor on-demand mirror — **do not invent a second policy here.**

When Will asks to **push** / **ship**:

1. `gate.sh build`（或 scoped `npm run build` / `build:ops`）— required; hooks block push without build marker
2. Targeted tests for touched logic: `node --import tsx --test …`
3. Print-agent: Docker `go test` + Windows cross-build
4. Then `git push origin main`（或指定分支）

Commit must already have passed lint+typecheck (`gate.sh check`). Do not skip push build because typecheck already ran.
